  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">GEDSI support unit (Global) 2026-31</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Gender Equality, Disability and Social Inclusion (GEDSI) support unit provides a central source of GEDSI services for DFAT end-users. Functions may include a range of gender equality and disability equity technical advice, and other enabling GEDSI services. This investment is an enabler to implement the International Development Policy and related strategies to strengthen GEDSI in Australia&apos;s aid program.</narrative>
  </description>
